      "bifenthrin (Brigade WSB) at 0.033 to 0.1 lb ai/A. PHI 7 days. REI 12 hr. Retreatment interval 7 days. Limit 5 treatments after bloom. Do not exceed 0.5 lb ai/A per season.",
      "bifenthrin (Capture LFR) at 0.04 to 0.08 lb ai/A soil applied in furrow with seed or transplant (armyworm only), at 0.033 to 0.1 lb ai/A foliar (armyworm and looper). PHI 7 days foliar. Retreatment interval 7 days foliar. REI 12 hr. Do not exceed 0.5 lb ai/A per season including at-plant plus foliar treatments.",
