      "chlorantraniliprole (Coragen) at 0.045 to 0.098 lb ai/A a) at planting; b) via drip irrigation; c) as foliar. PHI 3 days. REI 4 hr. Retreatment interval 3 days for foliar and 10 days for chemigation. Do not exceed 0.2 lb ai/A per season."
