      "flupyradifurone (Sivanto 200SL) at 0.14 to 0.18 lb ai/A foliar; 0.27 to 0.37 lb ai/A soil. PHI 1 day foliar; 45 days soil. REI 4 hr. Retreatment interval 7 days. Do not exceed 0.365 lb ai/A per season."
